efault":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-05-01T04:06:44Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T19:31:36Z","closed_at":"2025-05-01T19:31:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 80a3d205f (the latest at time of writing available from a merged PR)\n- Reproducible in fe38b5764 (the build associated with the PR for FTI change)\n- Not reproducible in ca15fcce0 (immediate preceding merged PR to FTI change)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev - Windows 11 - Single-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI first noticed this following #104269 in my game, where I have a pool of RigidBody3D nodes that are relatively short-lived (visually), but may be added or removed from the scene tree regularly. \n\nIt seems that when allowed to exit the tree, these bodies then have some intense visual artifacts any time they come back.\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e15a59ae-2294-43dc-bb6d-472a964eb6b1\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nHere's a small example of a situation I've noticed difficulty with:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node;\n\nconst POOL_SIZE: int = 5;\n\nvar pool: Array[RigidBody3D] = [];\nvar lifetimes: PackedFloat32Array = [];\nvar pool_index: int = 0;\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tpool.resize(POOL_SIZE);\n\tlifetimes.resize(POOL_SIZE);\n\tvar def: PackedScene = load(\"res://ball.tscn\");\n\tfor i in POOL_SIZE:\n\t\tpool[i] = def.instantiate();\n\treturn;\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tfor i in POOL_SIZE:\n\t\tvar ball: RigidBody3D = pool[i];\n\t\tif !ball.is_inside_tree():\n\t\t\tcontinue;\n\n\t\tvar lifetime: float = maxf(0.0, lifetimes[i] - delta);\n\t\tlifetimes[i] = lifetime;\n\t\tif (lifetime > 0.0):\n\t\t\tcontinue;\n\t\t\n\t\tball.visible = false;\n\t\tball.freeze = true;\n\t\tball.linear_velocity = Vector3();\n\t\tball.angular_velocity = Vector3();\n\t\tremove_child(ball);\t\n\treturn;\n\nfunc get_random_vector() -> Vector3:\n\treturn Vector3(randf_range(-1.0, 1.0), randf_range(-1.0, 1.0), randf_range(-1.0, 1.0));\n\nfunc add_ball() -> void:\n\tvar ball: RigidBody3D = pool[pool_index];;\n\tball.position = Vector3.UP * 2.5;\n\tball.visible = true;\n\tball.freeze = false;\n\n\tif !ball.is_inside_tree():\n\t\tadd_child(ball);\t\n\n\tball.apply_central_impulse(get_random_vector() * 2.0);\n\tball.reset_physics_interpolation();\n\n\tlifetimes[pool_index] = 2.0; \n\n\tpool_index = wrapi(pool_index + 1, 0, POOL_SIZE);\n\treturn;\n```\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[fti-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19996241/fti-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105970/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"h